{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10351250","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10351250","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1035125001:1":{"text":"Well, when foxes disappear, it's usually because wolves are about. This feels the same. Maybe there are creatures more terrifying than golems lurking nearby.","source_cn":"唉。狐狸的消失，有可能是因为狼出现了。我总觉得魔偶也是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87345C431B58D91F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035125002:1":{"text":"Although it seems to be safe now, we can't be certain just yet. Let's wait and see.","source_cn":"虽然现在看起来是很安全，但具体情况还不清楚。再等等看吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E8717F01F5F9178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035125003:1":{"text":"In any case, it's unlikely the golems would suddenly reemerge after completely disappearing.","source_cn":"不管怎么说，魔偶不会突然消失两天，又全部出现的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D8F82B92F834561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1035125003":{"text":"In any case, it's unlikely the golems would suddenly reemerge after completely disappearing.","source_cn":"不管怎么说，魔偶不会突然消失两天，又全部出现的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D8F82B92F834561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1035125004:1":{"text":"Ha, perhaps. I just don't want to put us in a worse situation.","source_cn":"哈，我也只是不想过得更惨而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A6FB0D1D02F38C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1035125005:1":{"text":"If we could afford to hire knights or mages to protect us, we wouldn't have to go to the Dark Forest, would we?","source_cn":"要是我们这些人请得起骑士或者魔法师来保护我们，还去什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0840D0F0C2A0416","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"You're very cautious.","source_cn":"你很谨慎","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEED8837D8383E115","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You're very cautious.","female":"You're very cautious.","variant_male_record_index":"62128","variant_female_record_index":"62129","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1035125006:1":{"text":"H-Hypofiends...? Are you sure?","source_cn":"魔、魔物？真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30763733ED1C57CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1035125007:1":{"text":"I was expecting ferocious monsters, but... nothing akin to Hypofiends! What should we do?","source_cn":"我本来以为是什么凶狠的野兽，没想到……竟然是魔物！那我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05C46798637F0C2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1035125007":{"text":"I was expecting ferocious monsters, but... nothing akin to Hypofiends! What should we do?","source_cn":"我本来以为是什么凶狠的野兽，没想到……竟然是魔物！那我们该怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05C46798637F0C2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1035125008:1":{"text":"Well, that's good news. Gives us time to prepare, I suppose.","source_cn":"那真是太好了。我们得多花点时间做准备。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2818374FC388F3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"You're safe for the moment.","source_cn":"魔物暂时威胁不到你们","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBDD1B2B1648EA899","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You're safe for the moment.","female":"You're safe for the moment.","variant_male_record_index":"62132","variant_female_record_index":"62133","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1035125009:1":{"text":"Right. We'll make sure the road is safe before we set off.","source_cn":"……明白了。我们会确保路上的安全再离开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA127CAB6FD47EF2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"Just be careful out there.","source_cn":"小心为上","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"